WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.123
The takeaway: finite-rank kernel ridge regression,
behind last-layer fine-tuning,

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:06.327
has sharp bounds, matching upper and lower,

00:00:06.407 --> 00:00:09.530
tight for any regularization including none.

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.733
The key idea,

00:00:12.813 --> 00:00:15.937
working in the eigenfunction basis to separate
spectrum from sampling noise,

00:00:16.017 --> 00:00:19.140
is a template others can borrow.
